on that night] is made distinct every precise matter -","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"44:5","t":"[Every] matter [proceeding] from Us. Indeed, We were to send [a messenger]","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"44:6","t":"As mercy from your Lord. Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Knowing,","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":6,"sd":null},{"k":"44:7","t":"Lord of the heavens and the earth and that between them, if you would be certain.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"44:8","t":"There is no deity except Him; He gives life and causes death. [He is] your Lord and the Lord of your first forefathers.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"44:9","t":"But they are in doubt, amusing themselves.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"44:10","t":"Then watch for the Day when the sky will bring a visible smoke","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"44:11","t":"Covering the people; this is a painful torment.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"44:12","t":"[They will say], \"Our Lord, remove from us the torment; indeed, we are believers.\"","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"44:13","t":"How will there be for them a reminder [at that time]? And there had come to them a clear Messenger.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"44:14","t":"Then they turned away from him and said, \"[He was] taught [and is] a madman.\"","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"44:15","t":"Indeed, We will remove the torment for a little. Indeed, you [disbelievers] will return [to disbelief].","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"44:16","t":"The Day We will strike with the greatest assault, indeed, We will take retribution.","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"44:17","t":"And We had already tried before them the people of Pharaoh, and there came to them a noble messenger [i.e., Moses],","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"44:18","t":"[Saying], \"Render to me the servants of Allāh. Indeed, I am to you a trustworthy messenger,\"","j":25,"h":50,"s":44,"a":18,"sd":null}],"juz":25,"hizb":50,"surahs":[44],"sajdah":false}